<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Yamama Cement lifts 96 net to 383 mln riyals.</title>
<headline>Saudi Yamama Cement lifts 96 net to 383 mln riyals.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		383.1     vs    369.2</p>
<p> Operating income	360.7     vs    355.7</p>
<p> Net operating income  330.5     vs    322.6</p>
<p> Other income	     65.1     vs     57.6</p>
<p> Pre-tax net profit    395.6     vs    380.2</p>
<p> Dividend		  333.0     vs     SAME</p>
<p> Shareholders funds  1,287.9     vs  1,240.3</p>
<p> Assets		  1,767.0     vs  1,689.7</p>
<p>Full Name: Yamama Cement Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based firm is one of eight cement companies operating in Saudi Arabia. ($1=3.75 riyals) -- Manama newsroom 973-536187</p>
</text>
